[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0315","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0315.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0380","title":"Cisco IOS HTTP 服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 11.1 至 12.1 版本的 HTTP 服务存在输入验证漏洞（CWE-20）。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标路由器的 HTTP 服务发送包含连续百分号（%%）的特制 URL 请求，触发服务崩溃，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Cisco 全系列路由器和交换机，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。攻击者只需知道目标设备 IP 地址即可发起攻击，利用难度低。Cisco 官方已发布安全公告，建议升级至 IOS 12.1 以上版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0380"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:35Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至 12.1(1) 或更高版本，该版本已修复 HTTP 服务对 `%%` 字符串的输入验证缺陷。如无法立即升级，可在全局配置模式下使用 `no ip http server` 命令关闭 HTTP 服务，或通过访问控制列表（ACL）限制仅允许受信任管理 IP 访问 HTTP 管理端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0261.html","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/ioshttpserver-pub.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/1302","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1154","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19882","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0380.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0380.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0380","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0380.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0380.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2dd0160b9ec0105216522022a89e49e69be74f7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g22v-2gp9-xpmh/GHSA-g22v-2gp9-xpmh.json","https://github.com/Hepburnsunsir/poc-/blob/3303182f1e0caa3228cb2b3ce8cd9147b237c5b7/routersploit/routersploit/modules/exploits/routers/cisco/CVE-2000-0380-pl.py","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0315.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0315.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0315.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0225","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0225.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0249","title":"IBM AIX Fast Response Cache Accelerator 本地任意文件修改漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 操作系统的 Fast Response Cache Accelerator (FRCA) 组件中的 frcactrl 程序存在配置安全缺陷，本地攻击者可利用该程序的配置功能修改系统任意文件，导致权限提升或系统完整性遭破坏。CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0249"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"2000-04-26T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"安装 IBM APAR IY06437 提供的 AIX 安全补丁，或升级至 AIX 5.2 及以上版本。临时缓解措施：执行 chmod 0500 /usr/sbin/frcactrl 移除 setuid root 权限，若未使用 FRCA 功能可删除该二进制文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1152","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise47.php3","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0249.json","https://github.com/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xwq6-j9m4-9grh/GHSA-xwq6-j9m4-9grh.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0225.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0225.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0327","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0327.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0326","title":"NetManage Meeting Maker 弱加密漏洞","description":"Meeting Maker 使用弱加密算法（多表代换密码）存储用户密码，远程攻击者可通过网络嗅探捕获加密后的密码数据，并利用该弱加密算法的可逆性进行解密，从而获取明文密码。该漏洞影响 Meeting Maker 所有版本，攻击者无需认证即可实施攻击，可能导致敏感账户信息泄露。建议升级至修复版本或采用强加密算法保护密码传输与存储。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0326"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:28Z","remediation":"建议升级 Meeting Maker 至 6.0 及以上版本（1998 年后版本引入了更强加密机制），或迁移至支持现代加密协议（如 TLS 1.2+ 及 AES-256）的日程管理方案。如无法升级，应在网络入口配置防火墙规则限制对 Meeting Maker 服务端口（默认 624/625 UDP）的访问，仅允许受信 IP 段连接，并通过 VPN 加密所有传输流量。避免在不可信网络中通过明文中继连接服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.on.com/support/mmxp.nsf/31af51e08bcc93eb852565a90056138b/11af70407a16b165852568c50056a952?OpenDocument","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1151","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0326.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0326","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0326.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0326.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p25g-qrm9-c6cx/GHSA-p25g-qrm9-c6cx.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1151/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001321.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d94d184c-6c47-465c-8557-68285fbe2e06.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0327.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0269","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0269.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0324","title":"Symantec pcAnywhere TCP SYN扫描拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Symantec pcAnywhere 8.x 及 9.0 版本存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标系统发送大量 TCP SYN 扫描数据包（如使用 nmap 工具），导致 pcAnywhere 服务进程崩溃或停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞利用方式简单，攻击门槛低，影响 pcAnywhere 8.0.1、8.0.2、9.0 及 9.2 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0324"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:28Z","remediation":"升级到 Symantec pcAnywhere 10.0 及以上版本。若无法升级，可在边界防火墙上限制对 pcAnywhere 服务端口（默认 TCP 5631）的源 IP，仅允许受信任的管理员地址访问；同时在服务器上启用 TCP SYN Cookie 保护（Linux: sysctl -w net.ipv4.tcp_syncookies=1；Windows Server: 设置注册表 HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\Tcpip\\Parameters\\SynAttackProtect=1）以缓解 SYN 类拒绝服务攻击。Symantec pcAnywhere 已于 2016 年停止支持，建议迁移至受支持的远程桌面解决方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0201.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0258.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/4347.php","http://www.osvdb.org/1301","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1150","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.3.96.1000425150157.13567A-100000%40sword.damocles.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19880","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0324.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0324","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0324.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0324.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f77g-jx4w-4qjp/GHSA-f77g-jx4w-4qjp.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0324.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b8bd3849-a75d-46e5-9eea-b8ce247120cf.json","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0269.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0709","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0709.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0248","title":"Red Hat Linux Piranha 虚拟服务器包 Web GUI 默认后门账户漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.2 的 Piranha 虚拟服务器软件包中，Web GUI 管理界面存在硬编码后门账户与密码漏洞。远程攻击者可通过使用预设的默认凭据登录管理后台，无需身份认证即可直接执行任意系统命令，完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 6.2 及早期版本中安装 Piranha 软件包的系统，危害等级严重，CVSS 评分 10.0。建议用户立即升级软件包或修改默认凭据。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0248"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-04-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:19Z","remediation":"立即删除 /etc/sysconfig/ha/lvs.cf 中默认的 \"piranha\" 账户及密码条目，或升级到 Red Hat 6.2 之后的安全更新版本。如无法升级，在 iptables 中限制对 9090 端口的访问来源 IP，仅允许管理地址连接 Web GUI。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise46.php3","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19879","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0248.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0248","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0248.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0248.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9rr2-45q8-fjmg/GHSA-9rr2-45q8-fjmg.json","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/cve_2_MSF_exploit_Mapping/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/d22f3c9e25f72f18a485d952583551d073f9cf47/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/df98cd885e49b66ef39b05ac11ddad1b492edabf/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/P/piranha.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0709.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0709.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0709.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0336","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0336.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0334","title":"Allaire Spectra 容器编辑器预览对象安全绕过漏洞","description":"Allaire Spectra 容器编辑器预览工具存在对象安全策略未正确执行漏洞，攻击者可通过向容器对象添加带有发布规则的对象方法（object-method）来绕过权限检查，从而执行未授权的操作。该漏洞影响 Allaire Spectra 系列产品，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，利用难度较低，可导致部分机密信息泄露。官方已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0334"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:30Z","remediation":"立即安装 Allaire 官方发布的 Spectra 安全补丁（参考 Allaire 安全公告 ID=15411）。由于 Allaire Spectra 产品已停止维护且厂商已被收购，建议迁移至其他受支持的容器内容管理平台，并在迁移前严格限制对容器编辑器的访问权限，仅允许受信任的管理员使用预览工具。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=15411&Method=Full","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1181","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0334.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0334","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0334.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0334.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2mm9-f8q6-86jx/GHSA-2mm9-f8q6-86jx.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0334.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/7e9d0f9f6e96f881defceb153c169913a330643d/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--a0c3032b-dc57-4aa3-ab85-238937767016.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0336.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0322","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0322.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0321","title":"IC Radius 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"IC Radius 软件包存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 RADIUS 认证服务发送特制的超长用户名字段触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务进程崩溃并拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 IC Radius 的早期版本，攻击无需身份认证即可远程利用，危害等级中危。修复方式为升级至已修补版本或严格限制用户名长度输入。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0321"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:28Z","remediation":"立即升级 IC Radius 至最新版本，或迁移至仍在维护的 RADIUS 实现（如 FreeRADIUS）。如无法升级，在 RADIUS 服务前端部署反向代理或防火墙规则，限制仅允许可信 IP 访问 UDP 1812/1813 端口，并在应用层对用户名输入长度进行严格校验（限制不超过 64 字符）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0190.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1147","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0321.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0321","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0321.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0321.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/radius_detect.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0321.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--af16d835-3396-4cd5-b99d-f33b4b6b851d.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/radius_detect.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0322.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0288","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0288.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0339","title":"Zone Labs ZoneAlarm 个人防火墙防火墙绕过漏洞","description":"Zone Labs ZoneAlarm 2.1.10 及更早版本的个人防火墙存在安全规则绕过漏洞。该软件未对源端口为 67（DHCP/BOOTP 服务端口）的 UDP 数据包进行过滤，导致远程攻击者可通过发送特制的源端口为 67 的 UDP 数据包绕过防火墙规则，实现未授权访问。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，影响防火墙的访问控制有效性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0339"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:30Z","remediation":"立即升级 ZoneAlarm 至 2.1.20 或更高版本，该版本已修复 UDP 源端口 67 绕过防火墙规则的问题。如无法升级，可在防火墙规则中手动添加一条阻止所有来自外部网络、源端口为 67 的 UDP 入站流量的规则作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1294","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1137","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000421044123.2353.qmail%40securityfocus.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19871","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0339.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0339","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0339.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0339.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g3hr-wqqr-vrqq/GHSA-g3hr-wqqr-vrqq.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/zone_alarm_fw_p67.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0339.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_bypass.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0288.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0283","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0283.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0337","title":"Sun Solaris Xsun 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 7.0 和 8.0 系统中的 Xsun X 服务器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 Xsun 的 -dev 参数传递超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，成功利用此漏洞可获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Solaris 7.0 及 8.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可实施攻击，完全控制目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0337"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:30Z","remediation":"立即安装 Solaris 7 的 Xsun 补丁 106577-xx（或 Solaris 8 的 108652-xx），可从 Oracle 支持网站下载。如无法打补丁，限制本地用户对 Xsun 二进制文件的执行权限（chmod 750 /usr/openwin/bin/Xsun），并移除不必要的 SUID 位作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0188.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1140","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19876","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0337.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0337","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0337.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0337.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jmw3-v7qc-2gx9/GHSA-jmw3-v7qc-2gx9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0337.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--398c3ef0-479c-476b-b1d6-74c36998956f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0283.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0283.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0283.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0267","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0267.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0322","title":"Red Hat Piranha 虚拟服务器套件 passwd.php3 任意命令执行漏洞","description":"Red Hat Piranha 虚拟服务器套件中的 passwd.php3 CGI 脚本存在命令注入漏洞，本地攻击者可通过在输入参数中注入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等）绕过输入过滤，导致任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Piranha 虚拟服务器套件，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者需具有本地访问权限，利用难度较低，Metasploit 框架已集成对应利用模块。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0322"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:28Z","remediation":"升级 Red Hat Piranha Virtual Server Package 至修复版本，或删除 passwd.php3 脚本。如无法升级，在 Apache 配置中限制该脚本仅允许本地访问（如 <Location /passwd.php3> Deny from all </Location>），并对用户输入做严格过滤，禁止 shell 元字符（; | & $ `）。","status":"comple