oml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0317","title":"Sun Solaris lpset 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 2.6 及 7.0 系统中的 lpset 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地用户可通过向 -r 选项传递超长字符串参数触发该漏洞，导致攻击者能够获取 root 权限。该漏洞源于 lpset 程序在处理命令行参数时未正确检查输入长度，造成栈缓冲区溢出。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需其他特殊条件即可利用。CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0317"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:27Z","remediation":"升级到 Solaris 8 GA 或更高版本（包括 Solaris 9、10、11），安装 Sun Microsystems/Oracle 发布的最终安全补丁包。目前 Solaris 7 已停止官方支持，建议迁移到现代 Solaris 版本。如无法立即升级，可使用群集安全管理工具限制本地用户权限，或通过修改权限属性（setuid）禁用对 lpset 命令的 root 访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0192.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0236.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95729763119559&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1138","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19874","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0317.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0317","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0317.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0317.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jhp4-7rfr-4p9v/GHSA-jhp4-7rfr-4p9v.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0317.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1138/info.html","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4f424782-69a1-4bf0-abf0-c864d936a21b.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0266.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0265","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0265.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0316","title":"Solaris lp 命令 -d 选项缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 操作系统中 lp 命令的 -d 选项存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 -d 参数传递超长字符串触发栈溢出，覆盖返回地址后获得 root 权限，从而实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.6 及 7.0 版本，利用需要系统本地访问权限，无需用户交互即可完成攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0316"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:27Z","remediation":"升级 Solaris 至 7.0 以上已修复版本，或安装 Sun 补丁 106980-01 (SPARC) / 106981-01 (x86)。临时缓解措施：以 root 执行 `chmod 4555 /usr/bin/lp` 移除 lp 的 setuid 位，或限制本地用户对 lp 命令的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0191.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1143","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19878","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0316.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0316","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0316.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0316.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-38cr-66jj-phh5/GHSA-38cr-66jj-phh5.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/solaris26_x86_106236.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0316.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/solaris7_x86_107116.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0265.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0319","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0319.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0319","title":"Sendmail mail.local 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Sendmail 8.10.x 版本中的 mail.local 组件在处理邮件消息时未能正确识别标识消息文本结束的 \".\\n\" 字符串，存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过发送一条长度为 2047 字符且以 \".\\n\" 结尾的特制邮件消息行，触发该漏洞，导致目标系统邮件服务拒绝服务或邮箱数据损坏。该漏洞影响 Sendmail 8.10.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0319"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:28Z","remediation":"升级至 Sendmail 8.11.0 及以上版本。当前最新稳定版为 8.18.2，可从 ftp.sendmail.org 获取。如无法升级，可通过防火墙限制对 SMTP 端口（25/tcp）的访问来源，仅允许受信任的邮件服务器连接，减少外部攻击面。同时建议监控 mail.local 日志中异常长的邮件行。对于已废弃的旧系统，建议迁移至维护中的邮件传输代理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1146","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=2694.000424%40SECURITY.NNOV.RU","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0319.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0319","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcce